{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEED THE QUEEN is a strategy incremental game with a focus on synergy-building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your colony and create a wide variety of specialized workers of unique shapes and sizes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135750/extras/501d66edc6884ebd18555f16f3f2f81c.poster.avif?t=1772434932\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135750/extras/501d66edc6884ebd18555f16f3f2f81c.webm?t=1772434932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135750/extras/501d66edc6884ebd18555f16f3f2f81c.mp4?t=1772434932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produce, gather, transform and combine different types of food with unique attributes, values and effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize your workforce: find the right balance between production and delivery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consume more and more food to advance the species to the next step of its evolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135750/extras/6a21e7f21470ea0fb7bd7a02e8d2487f.poster.avif?t=1772434932\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135750/extras/6a21e7f21470ea0fb7bd7a02e8d2487f.webm?t=1772434932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135750/extras/6a21e7f21470ea0fb7bd7a02e8d2487f.mp4?t=1772434932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover, experiment, and perfect your favorite strategies:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully spend your Brain Matter, a rare and limited resource used to unlock the most advanced of upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and spend DNA points in the genetics talent tree to personalize each colony.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cumulate different types of bonuses through your selection of foods and upgrades.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135750/extras/68a2359e19b5248faabaa68cad32afa4.poster.avif?t=1772434932\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135750/extras/68a2359e19b5248faabaa68cad32afa4.webm?t=1772434932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135750/extras/68a2359e19b5248faabaa68cad32afa4.mp4?t=1772434932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features a cute hand-drawn art-style and an original soundtrack. Everything here was made with love by humans. :)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4135750?t=1772434932","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135750/b0d00729ce7cc9a83d5d55815773eabe55f8c870/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772434932","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135750/1c6c3c2385f4fdd28ed5ab7ab6f8e529dd1770d6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772434932","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135750/1c6c3c2385f4fdd28ed5ab7ab6f8e529dd1770d6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772434932","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievemen